/Dest /cite_note-FOOTNOTERausa-Gomez1967Lourdes_Rausa-Gomez_cited_Sir_Stamford_Raffles,_himself_citing_the_'Traditional_History_of_Java'_wherein_he_said_that_Manila_and_Sulu_in_the_Philippines_were_part_of_Majapahapit,_however_she_doubted_the_veracity_of_Stamford_Raffles_assertion_due_to_the_lack_of_archaeological_evidence_between_Majapahit_and_the_Philippines_in_her_1967_article._However,_that_article_has_been_renderred_outdated_due_to_the_discovery_of_the_Laguna_Copperplate_Inscription_in_1989_which_proved_links_between_Java_and_Manila,_which_makes_her_dismissal_of_the_Raffles_assertion_null_and_the_Raffles_assertion_feasible-136
/StructParent 660>>
